-- created_at is the LOAD date, not a session date: the corpus has no per-project
-- creation date and 001 gives the column no default. worker/supervisor budgets
-- are left at their 001 defaults (an archive-derived project has no budget
-- semantics). parent_project_id stays NULL — no nesting, by instruction.
